<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Sept industry output up 4.9 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Hungary Sept industry output up 4.9 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial output in September was 4.9 percent up from August and 2.5 percent higher than in September 1995, compared with a year-on-year rise of 2.1 percent in September 1995, the Central Statistical Office said in a statement on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY INDUSTRY OUTPUT (Pct change)</p>
<p>		  Jan-Sept'96  Jan-Aug'96  Sept'96  Aug'96  Sept'95</p>
<p> Monthly change     n.a.	 n.a.	+4.9    -9.1    -2.6</p>
<p>Year-on-year</p>
<p>   change (pct)    +1.5	 +1.3	 +2.5    -3.2    +2.4</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
